  "CMD28 上电保护{0}；CMD28 永久保护{1}；上电保护设置{2}；永久保护设置{3}；CSD 永久保护设置{4}；密码保护功能{5}（配置不代表各保护组的实际锁定状态）": "CMD28 power-on protection {0}; CMD28 permanent protection {1}; power-on settings {2}; permanent settings {3}; CSD permanent settings {4}; password protection {5} (configuration does not indicate actual lock states of protection groups)",
  "· SDR 每时钟传一次，DDR 每时钟传两次。带宽按 8 位数据线计算，仅为接口理论上限，实际读写受 NAND、控制器及工作负载影响。支持协议与当前协商协议分别展示。": "· SDR transfers once per clock; DDR transfers twice. Bandwidth assumes an 8-bit bus and is only a theoretical interface limit. Actual throughput depends on NAND, controller and workload. Supported and negotiated protocols are shown separately.",
  "上电写保护启用{0}（{1}）；永久写保护启用{2}（{3}）；上电保护设置{4}；永久保护设置{5}": "Power-on write protection enabled {0} ({1}); permanent write protection enabled {2} ({3}); power-on settings {4}; permanent settings {5}",
  "分钟 · 每 3 秒刷新": "minutes · refreshes every 3 seconds",
  "厂商名称由 CID 制造商 ID 识别，代表 eMMC 器件厂商。内部 NAND 裸晶型号、生产厂商和 MLC/TLC 工艺不由标准寄存器提供，无法仅凭 H8G4a 产品名确定；进一步识别需核对芯片封装丝印与对应厂商资料。": "The CID manufacturer ID identifies the eMMC device vendor. Standard registers do not report the NAND die model, manufacturer or MLC/TLC technology; the H8G4a product name alone cannot determine them. Check package markings and vendor documentation for further identification.",
  "字节 · 直接流式传输，可导出整个区域；关闭下载会中断传输。": "bytes · direct streaming supports the entire region; closing the download interrupts transfer. ",
  "字节。1 KiB = 1024 B；1 MiB = 1024 KiB；1 GiB = 1024 MiB。": " bytes. 1 KiB = 1024 B; 1 MiB = 1024 KiB; 1 GiB = 1024 MiB.",
  "完整备份包含原始镜像、分区表、设备信息与 SHA-256 校验清单。下载到电脑后，可随时重新导入恢复。": "Full backups include raw images, partition tables, device information and SHA-256 checksums. After downloading, you can import them again for restoration.",
  "寿命值是按 10% 档位报告的磨损估计，不是精确剩余百分比或剩余使用年限。A/B 对应设备定义的两类存储区，具体介质类型由厂商定义。预警区间表示备用块已消耗比例，与 A/B 磨损估计是不同指标；未提供和保留值不会当作健康正常。": "Lifetime values estimate wear in 10% bands, not exact remaining percentages or years. A/B refer to two storage classes defined by the vendor. Warning ranges describe spare block consumption, a separate metric from A/B wear. Unreported and reserved values are not treated as healthy.",
  "标准寄存器优先显示解析结果，括号内保留原始值。CID、UUID 及厂商固件编码保留原样；保留位或未知值明确标注，不推断含义。": "Standard registers show decoded values first, with raw values in parentheses. CID, UUID and vendor firmware codes remain unchanged. Reserved bits and unknown values are identified explicitly without guessing.",
